  "input": {
    "structured_en": "[Span arrangement] Single simply supported span of 30 m (centre-to-centre of bearings); deck width 12.5 m.\n[Section and material] Precast prestressed T girders, 5 per span; middle-girder section at midspan: depth 2 m; precast flange 1.80 m wide, 0.18 m thick over the outer 0.20 m and thickening linearly to 0.27 m at the web; web 0.20 m thick; bottom bulb 0.60 m wide with a 0.20 m vertical part and a 0.20 m high linear transition to the web; girder concrete C40. Consider the self-weight of the main girders only (no wet joints, diaphragms, pavement or barriers).\n[Bearings and boundary] Abutments at both ends. Abutment 0 and Abutment 1: plain laminated elastomeric bearings, one under each girder end; effective plan size 300 mm x 400 mm, five internal rubber layers 8 mm thick.\n[Design standard] Highway Class I loading (JTG D60-2015); one-way traffic, carriageway width 11.5 m, three design lanes.",
    "structured_zh": "【跨径布置】单跨简支，计算跨径 30 m（支座中心线间距）；桥面全宽 12.5 m。\n【截面与材料】预制预应力混凝土 T 梁，每跨 5 片；中梁跨中截面：梁高 2 m；预制翼缘宽 1.80 m，外侧 0.20 m 范围厚 0.18 m，向腹板线性增厚至 0.27 m；腹板厚 0.20 m；马蹄宽 0.60 m，竖直段高 0.20 m，经 0.20 m 高线性过渡段接腹板；主梁混凝土 C40。只计主梁自重（不计湿接缝、横隔板、铺装与护栏）。\n【支座与边界】两端为桥台。0 号台、1 号台：普通板式橡胶支座，每个梁端 1 个；有效平面尺寸 300 mm × 400 mm，中间橡胶层 5 层、每层厚 8 mm。\n【设计标准】公路-I 级（JTG D60-2015）；单向行驶，行车道宽 11.5 m，设计车道数 3。"
  },
